      "side": 1,
      "message": "Once you convert change the temp sensor shim to use `struct gpio_dt_spec`, you will need to reference the gpio directly;\n```\npower-gpios \u003d \u003c\u0026gpiob 7 0\u003e;\n```\n\nAlso, is there a power good signal that is already configured as an input?    \n\nThe temp_sensor shim should call `gpio_pin_configure_dt()` for the power-gpio, but if the GPIO is an output used the power sequencing, we don\u0027t want to configure it twice.",
